[16.75, "o", "\u001b[mFix the task CLI: --status open and --status done currently return every task. Run the existing unittest suite first  \u001b[18;1H  to reproduce it, implement filtering without modifying the input list, add an empty-list regression test, and rerun   \u001b[19;1H  tests. Show the real CLI output for --status open and a concise git diff. Do not commit.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u2022 \u001b[2mWorking\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(1s \u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1mesc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n\u203a\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mAsk Codex to do anything\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  GPT-6.1-Sol low \u00b7 ~/demo/worktrees/demo/1 \u00b7 \u280f\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m?\u001b(B\u001b[m for shortcuts\u001b[78X\u001b[78C\u26a0 1 warning \u00b7 \u001b[1mf2\u001b(B\u001b[m to view \u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[26;3H"]
