[18.829, "o", "e real CLI output for --status open and a concise git diff. Do not commit.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[mI\u2019ll run the existing tests first, check repository visibility, then fix the status filter and verify the CLI output  \u001b[21;1H  without committing.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n\u25e6\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mWorking\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(3s \u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1mesc\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m to interrupt)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n\u203a\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mAsk Codex to do anything\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  GPT-6.1-Sol low \u00b7 ~/demo/worktrees/demo/1 \u00b7 \u2819\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m?\u001b(B\u001b[m for shortcuts\u001b[78X\u001b[78C\u26a0 1 warning \u00b7 \u001b[1mf2\u001b(B\u001b[m to view \u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[26;3H"]
