[41.613, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[H\u203a \u001b(B\u001b[mFix the task CLI: --status open and --status done currently return every task. Run the existing unittest suite first\u2026 \u001b[2;1H  bare repository on your SSH host with no public hosting remote configured, so no public issue is needed. I\u2019ll add     \u001b[3;1H  filtering plus regressions for empty input and preserving the input list.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n\u2022 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1mEdited\u001b(B\u001b[m 2 files (+15 -2)\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  \u2514 \u001b(B\u001b[mtasks.py (+3 -2)\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m 7 \u001b(B\u001b[m-    # Filtering is not wired up yet.\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m 8 \u001b(B\u001b[m-    return tasks\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m 7 \u001b(B\u001b[m+    if status == \"all\":\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  \u2514 \u001b(B\u001b[mtest_tasks.py (+12 -0)\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m24 \u001b(B\u001b[m+    def test_empty_tasks(self):\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m25 \u001b(B\u001b[m+        for status in (\"all\", \"open\", \"done\"):\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2m26 \u001b(B\u001b[m+\u001b[12X\u001b[12Cwith self.subTest(status=status):\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    + Show details                                                                                                      \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[16;1H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n\u2022\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m python3 -m unittes"]
